---
import { getWhatsAppUrl } from '../config/tinkerly.config';
const wa = getWhatsAppUrl();
---
  <section id="contacto" class="tk-section tk-contact">
    <div class="tk-container tk-contact__banner" data-reveal>
      <svg class="tk-contact__sparkle tk-contact__sparkle--left" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M20 3c1.7 10.4 6.6 15.3 17 17-10.4 1.7-15.3 6.6-17 17C18.3 26.6 13.4 21.7 3 20 13.4 18.3 18.3 13.4 20 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
      </svg>
      <svg class="tk-contact__sparkle tk-contact__sparkle--right" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M20 3c1.7 10.4 6.6 15.3 17 17-10.4 1.7-15.3 6.6-17 17C18.3 26.6 13.4 21.7 3 20 13.4 18.3 18.3 13.4 20 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
      </svg>
      <p class="tk-kicker">PEDIDOS PERSONALIZADOS</p>
      <h2>¿Qué te gustaría <em>personalizar?</em></h2>
      <p>Cuéntanos qué producto buscas, cuántas unidades necesitas y si tienes alguna referencia.</p>
      {wa ? <a class="tk-button tk-button--primary" href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Escríbenos por WhatsApp <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a> : <a class="tk-button tk-button--primary" href="#ideas">Explorar ideas <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>}
    </div>
  </section>
